  "2026-10-26T06:56:43.400Z",codex-agent,"Verified GitHub website: https://pm-cli.unbrained.dev/packages/pm-graph. Local linked checks passed: npm run lint; npm run typecheck; npm run pack:dry-run. Package metadata now matches the owner request and repository/bugs are unchanged. Metadata-only change: no runtime behavior changes, so behavioral revert proof is not applicable. Full release gates are delegated to CI as requested; no release or merge performed."
